  "notes_zh": "《上海虹口同仁醫院清單》記錄上海虹口同仁醫院 1913 年 9 月至 1914 年 9 月的董事及職員、就診條例、院務紀事、門診與住院統計及收支捐款。本資料依中國國家圖書館 13jh007190／105055 底本，含封面、印本正文、逐欄表格、圖案與現代館藏標記的位置。",
  "notes_en": "This report of Tongren Hospital in Hongkou, Shanghai covers the year from 16 September 1913 to 15 September 1914. It includes its board and staff roster, admission regulations, institutional notes, service statistics, accounts, and donor lists. This dataset transcribes the National Library of China copy 13jh007190 / 105055, with reading and source pointers for all 18 scan frames.",
  "quality_summary": "全冊經兩份隔離 AI 原圖讀稿比對，附逐頁異讀與回圖訂正，未定字仍標示。尚待人工校對。",
