      "units": [
        {
          "id": "p005-c01",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "醫者須另加開刀費自五元至一百元不等以視其症之重輕為",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "p005-c02",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "率",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "p005-c03",
          "kind": "heading",
          "layer": "heading",
          "text": "一種痘",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "p005-c04",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "自十月起至五月止每禮拜施種牛痘三次逢禮拜一三六為布",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "p005-c05",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "種之期來種者概不收費",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "p005-c06",
          "kind": "heading",
          "layer": "heading",
          "text": "一出診",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "p005-c07",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "倘有請本院醫生出診者亦可其醫金洋自五元起至八元止不",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 6
        },
        {
          "id": "p005-c08",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "等若實在無力者准可免費",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 7
        },
        {
          "id": "p005-c09",
          "kind": "heading",
          "layer": "heading",
          "text": "一實驗室",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 8
        },
        {
          "id": "p005-c10",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "本室專驗病人一切疑難雜症本院今復增辦一切最新式最有",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 9
        },
        {
          "id": "p005-c11",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "效用之器無不完備可以細察病家之眞實病源得以應手奏效",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 10
        },
        {
          "id": "p005-c12",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "不負來者之所求焉",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 11
        },
        {
          "id": "p005-c13",
          "kind": "running",
          "layer": "running",
          "text": "同仁醫院清單",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 12
        },
        {
          "id": "p005-c14",
          "kind": "folio",
          "layer": "folio",
          "text": "四",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 13
        }
      ],
      "layer_states": {
        "body": "complete",
        "heading": "complete",
        "running": "complete",
        "folio": "complete"
      }
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p006",
      "image": 6,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/90/NLC416-13jh007190-105055_%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E8%99%B9%E5%8F%A3%E5%90%8C%E4%BB%81%E9%86%AB%E9%99%A2%E6%B8%85%E5%96%AE.pdf#page=6",
      "source_sha256": "9afe67037745d5bf8bb3a08d9045778f1fad19748dbda475ab28aab5b56754e1",
      "width": 1187,
      "height": 1600,
      "bytes": 123351,
      "layout_reviewed": true,
      "units": [
        {
          "id": "p006-c01",
          "kind": "heading",
          "layer": "heading",
          "text": "本年紀事",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "p006-c02",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "本院自創辦迄今已越四十有八載歷盡千百艱辛庶克臻此大備即以去秋",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "p006-c03",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "較之今歲更覺興旺治理醫務亦見進步本院現任諸醫士有在美國醫學專",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "p006-c04",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "科畢業者四位中國畢業者四位其間有德奧格醫士去歲返國今已回院任",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "p006-c05",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "事經此一番往返體魄精神尤增強健又如刁信德醫生於前歲專誠赴美考",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "p006-c06",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "察最新醫學今亦回院主持調驗事務無不盡心體察更有麥克根醫士曾在",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "p006-c07",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "粵省施醫七年兼任本薛文義醫學校事今因該校併設滬江聖約翰大學校",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 6
        },
        {
          "id": "p006-c08",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "內因此麥君能得來滬任理本院醫事回憶去歲院中醫士尚少於今而負病",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 7
        },
        {
          "id": "p006-c09",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "求診者年復增廣雖得各醫士照常擔負恆有病牀不敷之憂故於今歲特添",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 8
        },
        {
          "id": "p006-c10",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "看護服役等人以及添置器具藥品與種種便人之事固不畢舉更望將來再",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 9
        },
        {
          "id": "p006-c11",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "能擴充病室尤所深願向我本院中醫辦事亦甚得手惜乎譚虞二醫生於今",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 10
        },
        {
          "id": "p006-c12",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "秋自行告辭離院幸喜吳慶元及高恩養二醫士允聘來院以承斯職尤喜哈",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 11
        },
        {
          "id": "p006-c13",
          "kind": "running",
          "layer": "running",
          "text": "同仁醫院清單",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 12
        },
        {
          "id": "p006-c14",
          "kind": "folio",
          "layer": "folio",
          "text": "五",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 13
        }
      ],
      "layer_states": {
        "heading": "complete",
        "body": "complete",
        "running": "complete",
        "folio": "complete"
      }
    },
    {
      "page_id": "p007",
      "image": 7,
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/90/NLC416-13jh007190-105055_%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E8%99%B9%E5%8F%A3%E5%90%8C%E4%BB%81%E9%86%AB%E9%99%A2%E6%B8%85%E5%96%AE.pdf#page=7",
      "source_sha256": "e0b51c91350f8fc5e53faa7e58a7c125a77858be1a3534c189f051dae559bd92",
      "width": 1187,
      "height": 1600,
      "bytes": 78435,
      "layout_reviewed": true,
      "units": [
        {
          "id": "p007-c01",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "佛醫院允許常川三位醫士來院以盡義務又若本院看護女士本祇二位今",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "p007-c02",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "又增聘吉小姐一位聯前三位俾便病人較為周到致於陶養病人之道德則",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "p007-c03",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "有湯老牧師與汪會吏等主任勸導而湯牧師年已耄耋誕慶八旬同院咸深",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "p007-c04",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "欣羨皆曰其能導人於善故天佑之以壽亦天欲假其人與衆醫士以福病者",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 3
        },
        {
          "id": "p007-c05",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "更得中西各行號及諸大善士之不吝囊金慨然施濟故此本年本院得以治",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "p007-c06",
          "kind": "body",
          "layer": "body",
          "text": "愈病人將及十萬此不獨本院之幸而於各病家更當感戴靡暨焉",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 5
        },
        {
          "id": "p007-c07",
          "kind": "running",
          "layer": "running",
          "text": "同仁醫院清單",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 6
        },
        {
          "id": "p007-c08",
          "kind": "folio",
          "layer": "folio",
          "text": "六",
          "bbox": null,
          "order": 7
        }
      ],
      "layer_states": {
        "body": "complete",
        "running": "complete",
        "folio": "complete"
      }
    },
